<%#
  An unknown, tampered or expired link, or one for a signup that was never
  confirmed and has since been deleted. The same page for all of them, and
  the way forward is the same too: ask again.
%>
<%# Own address carries a bearer token — see marketing.html.erb's use of this flag. %>
<% content_for :credential_page, true %>
<% content_for :title, "That link has expired — Remindly" %>

<h1>That link has expired</h1>

<p class="lead">
  Confirmation links work for 7 days. Enter your address again to ask for a
  fresh one. If you are already on the list, there is nothing more to do.
</p>

<%= render "shared/subscribe_form", source: "reconfirm" %>
